content.thinking:
Now the WarmUpService. Key logic as designed. Careful details:

- createTicket: idempotent check; lockKiln via kilnLockRepository.lockKiln (serializes concurrent creates per kiln); re-check idempotent after lock (like submit); tryAcquireKiln → conflict; insert ticket + stage 1; save idempotent.

Wait — existing kiln_lock table is used by plan submit. Reusing lockKiln for warmup create and feed is fine (row per kiln, MERGE+FOR UPDATE).

- Curve stages from properties.getWarmUp().getStages(); sorted by stageNo. Validate non-empty.

confirmStage flow (detailed):

```java
@Transactional
public StageConfirmResponse confirmStage(String ticketNo, StageConfirmRequest request) {
    String fingerprint = ...;
    var existing = idempotentRepository.find(request.requestId());
    if (existing != null) {
        if (!existing.requestType().equals("WARMUP_STAGE_CONFIRM")) throw 409;
        if (!existing.fingerprint().equals(fingerprint)) throw 409;
        return readJson(...);
    }
    WarmUpTicket ticket = requireTicket(ticketNo);
    ticket = ticketRepository.lockById(ticket.id());
    if (ticket.status() == COMPLETED) throw 422 ILLEGAL_STATE;
    WarmUpStage stage = stageRepository.findCurrentStage(ticket.id());
    LocalDateTime now = now();
    if (!stageRepository.insertConfirm(ticket.id(), stage.stageNo(), request.operator(), now)) {
        throw 422 ILLEGAL_STATE "操作人已确认过当前阶段，须另一名操作人复核";
    }
    List<String> operators = stageRepository.findConfirmOperators(ticket.id(), stage.stageNo());
    if (operators.size() < 2) {
        response = PENDING_SECOND with ticketStatus current;
        save idempotent; return;
    }
    // 双人齐全
    String confirmStatus;
    if (stage.stageType() == RAMP) {
        boolean tempReached = request.currentTemp().compareTo(stage.targetTemp()) >= 0;
        boolean durationUp = !stage.startedAt().plusMinutes(stage.maxDurationMinutes()).isAfter(now);
        if (tempReached) {
            confirmStatus = advanceRamp(ticket, stage, operators, now);
        } else if (durationUp) {
            // 恰满最长用时未达目标：转保温段
            stageRepository.markConfirmed(stage.id(), now, operators.get(0), operators.get(1));
            WarmUpStage hold = new WarmUpStage(null, ticket.id(), stage.stageNo()+1, HOLD, stage.curveStageNo(), ticket.curveVersion(), stage.targetTemp(), null, now, null, null, null);
            stageRepository.insertStage(hold);
            updateProgress(ticket.id(), EXECUTING, HOLDING, stage.stageNo()+1, now, null);
            confirmStatus = "HOLD_ENTERED";
        } else {
            throw 422 "阶段未达目标温度且未满最长用时";
        }
    } else { // HOLD
        boolean tempReached = currentTemp >= stage.targetTemp;
        if (!tempReached) throw 422 "保温段温度未达目标";
        stageRepository.markConfirmed(...);
        confirmStatus = advanceRamp(ticket, stage, operators, now); // from HOLDING
    }
    WarmUpTicket updated = ticketRepository.findById(ticket.id());
    response = new StageConfirmResponse(ticketNo, stage.stageNo(), stage.stageType().name(), confirmStatus, operators, updated.status().name());
    idempotentRepository.trySave(request.requestId(), "WARMUP_STAGE_CONFIRM", fingerprint, 200, writeJson(response), ticket.id());
    return response;
}

private String advanceRamp(WarmUpTicket ticket, WarmUpStage stage, List<String> operators, LocalDateTime now) {
    stageRepository.markConfirmed(stage.id(), now, operators.get(0), operators.get(1));
    int lastCurveStage = lastCurveStageNo();
    if (stage.curveStageNo() >= lastCurveStage) {
        ticketRepository.updateProgress(ticket.id(), ticket.status(), COMPLETED, stage.stageNo(), null, now);
        ticketRepository.releaseKiln(ticket.kilnId());
        return "COMPLETED";
    }
    CurveStage next = curveStage(stage.curveStageNo() + 1);
    stageRepository.insertStage(new WarmUpStage(null, ticket.id(), stage.stageNo()+1, RAMP, next.getStageNo(), ticket.curveVersion(), next.getTargetTemp(), next.getMaxDurationMinutes(), now, null, null, null));
    ticketRepository.updateProgress(ticket.id(), ticket.status(), EXECUTING, stage.stageNo()+1, null, null);
    return "ADVANCED";
}
```

Wait: markConfirmed for HOLD branch — I call advanceRamp which does markConfirmed. For RAMP tempReached → advanceRamp. For HOLD tempReached → advanceRamp. Good, so markConfirmed only inside advanceRamp and HOLD_ENTERED branch.

Note: updateProgress expected status = ticket.status() (EXECUTING or HOLDING). Check return count; if 0 throw conflict (shouldn't happen under row lock).

feed:

```java
@Transactional
public FeedResponse feed(FeedRequest request) {
    idempotent check (type FEED_REQUEST);
    kilnLockRepository.lockKiln(request.kilnId());
    re-check idempotent after lock? For consistency do it.
    WarmUpTicket ticket = ticketRepository.findLatestByKiln(request.kilnId());
    if (ticket == null || ticket.status() != COMPLETED) throw 422 CURVE_NOT_FINISHED;
    long feedId = feedRecordRepository.insert(request.requestId(), request.kilnId(), ticket.id(), now);
    response...; save idempotent; return.
}
```

scanHoldTimeouts:

```java
@Transactional
public int scanHoldTimeouts() {
    LocalDateTime deadline = now().minusHours(properties.getWarmUp().getHoldTimeoutHours());
    int raised = 0;
    for (WarmUpTicket t : ticketRepository.findHoldingOverdue(deadline)) {
        raised += stageRepository.insertAlarmIfAbsent(t.id(), t.currentStageNo(), "HOLD_TIMEOUT", now());
    }
    return raised;
}
```

status(ticketNo): build WarmUpTicketResponse from ticket + current stage + operators.

createTicket:

```java
@Transactional
public WarmUpTicketResponse createTicket(WarmUpTicketCreateRequest request) {
    fingerprint; existing check (type WARMUP_TICKET_CREATE);
    kilnLockRepository.lockKiln(request.kilnId());
    committed re-check;
    List<CurveStage> stages = sorted curve stages; if empty throw IllegalStateException;
    LocalDateTime now = now();
    String ticketNo = generate;
    WarmUpTicket ticket = new WarmUpTicket(null, request.requestId(), ticketNo, request.kilnId(), version, EXECUTING, 1, null, now, null);
    long ticketId = ticketRepository.insert(ticket);
    if (!ticketRepository.tryAcquireKiln(request.kilnId(), ticketId, now)) {
        throw conflict WARMUP_TICKET_ACTIVE;
    }
    CurveStage first = stages.get(0);
    stageRepository.insertStage(new WarmUpStage(null, ticketId, 1, RAMP, first.getStageNo(), version, first.getTargetTemp(), first.getMaxDurationMinutes(), now, null, null, null));
    response = toResponse(ticketRepository.findById(ticketId));
    idempotentRepository.trySave(...);
    return response;
}
```

Note: insert ticket before tryAcquireKiln — if acquire fails, transaction rolls back including ticket insert. Good.

TicketNo generation: "WU" + yyyyMMddHHmmssSSS + 3-digit random, same as plan.

toResponse: load current stage + operators.

Curve helper:
```java
private List<CementProperties.CurveStage> curveStages() {
    return properties.getWarmUp().getStages().stream()
        .sorted(Comparator.comparingInt(CementProperties.CurveStage::getStageNo)).toList();
}
```

